      "jobId": "435df12e-f356-422a-89d6-bfa5346b4a24",
      "question": "Which active loans are most likely to be 30 or more days past due within the next 90 days?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T04:41:06.974492Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T04:41:37.737111Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Based on the Kumo prediction model (loan delinquency template, anchored to 2026-10-01), here are the **top 25 active loans** most likely to have an installment 30+ days past due within the next 90 days, ranked by predicted probability:\n\n| Loan ID | Predicted Probability (30+ DPD in 90 days) |\n|---------|--------------------------------------------|\n| L00487  | 61.5% |\n| L00530  | 59.1% |\n| L00580  | 57.2% |\n| L00221  | 57.0% |\n| L00486  | 56.0% |\n| L00444  | 54.7% |\n| L00168  | 54.3% |\n| L00370  | 53.9% |\n| L00596  | 53.3% |\n| L00182  | 51.4% |\n| L00124  | 49.6% |\n| L00593  | 48.6% |\n| L00307  | 48.0% |\n| L00458  | 48.0% |\n| L00403  | 45.1% |\n| L00516  | 44.6% |\n| L00190  | 41.3% |\n| L00220  | 41.1% |\n| L00583  | 40.4% |\n| L00336  | 40.0% |\n| L00138  | 39.4% |\n| L00404  | 38.9% |\n| L00616  | 37.8% |\n| L00154  | 35.9% |\n| L00504  | 35.8% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Limitations:** The model scored 593 active loans but returns only the 25 highest probabilities (per Kumo's 1,000-entity request limit). For a fuller view or to inspect specific loan details (product, borrower segment, DTI/LTV at origination), you can query the `loans` table joined with `customers`.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — loan_delinquency_90d — evidence `hermes-receipt:9d9a3221f8d2f4b04dffa10ffbfa72763e46cade37e3d7f7a832aa615e9ce4d3`",
